cff-version: 1.2.0
title: arena-evidence-seal
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. The sealed numbers
  are a byte-copy of a synthetic arena benchmark; SHA-256 matching proves
  byte-consistency only, not authorship, provenance, or validity.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Brisson
    given-names: Jean-François
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9778-5374
    affiliation: Spark AI NLP
version: 0.1.0
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/arena-evidence-seal
abstract: >-
  Evidence-passport seal over a membrane-arena benchmark: a deterministic
  manifest plus SHA-256 artifact verification and a fail-closed verify
  command. Bar met on the fixture benchmark: seal verifies and sealed
  numbers match benchmark.json byte-for-byte. Classical synthetic toy;
  Mun Seok Lee is cited as inspiration only for the Digital to Wave
  paradigm.
